      "description": "A selection decision was made on a lower bound: a list maximum read as at least settled a comparison of a gate, a threshold of a term, or an identity term taken at the bound, for some candidate; rule_id names the first such gate or term in document order (the gates before the terms) and count how many gates and terms were, once per decision, before the outcome's reasons (Workflow #428 S168-LB1b).",
